 "notes": "A genome-scale metabolic network with no rate laws, driven as a black box by dynamic FBA (cobra). Open boundary: biomass drains atoms out of the tracked medium, and the exchange reactions are the declared boundary. Identity is a canonical ChEBI entity_id (so this box's pyruvate reconciles with a kinetic model's pyruvate), and each formula carries the species' actual atoms (the pyruvate anion is C3H3O3, not a neutralized form). BiGG species ids are provenance (see the port_map / EX_ reaction ids), not identity. Charge is not tracked here (genome-scale charge balance is a separate concern); acid/base boxes such as carbonate_system declare it.",
